					"nextDialogs": [
						130100613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130100613,
					"content": "也许是记录归寂之庭的罐装知识数量不多，被他们带走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛诺"
				},
				{
					"id": 130100614,
					"content": "#没关系，我还有一个办法。{NICKNAME}，你们原路返回，而我藏在这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130100615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛诺"
				},
				{
